    "lyrics": [],
    "structure": "146 bars, 36 systems, 3 per page (page breaks before every 3rd system). Thema mm.1-16 (||: implied :|| ||: :||, \"To Coda\" + coda sign after m.8); Var. I mm.17-32; Var. II mm.33-49 (1st ending m.40, 2nd ending m.41 + double bar); Var. III mm.50-65; Var. IV Minore mm.66-81 (A minor); Var. V Maggiore mm.82-98 (A major, 1st ending m.97, 2nd ending m.98); Var. VI mm.99-114; Var. VII mm.115-130 (only the first half repeated; double bar + \"D.C. al Coda\" after m.130); Coda sign + Coda mm.131-146, final bar. Every start+end repeat between sections falls on a system break and is split by the line break. Played form: Thema and Var. I-VII with repeats, then D.C.: mm.1-8, jump to the Coda (m.131).",
    "notes": "One part (Piano), grand staff, must NOT be split. 2/4 throughout. Key A major (3 sharps); Var. IV in A minor (0 sharps, key change with cancellation naturals), Var. V back to A major. Section headings (Thema, Var. I ...) are bold text; tempo texts Andante (quarter = 69), Adagio (quarter = 50), Tempo I, Più mosso. Running header with title and page number on pages 2-12."
  },
